# AC-1 — Media constraints

Covered by `com.hotel.media.MediaIT#shouldEnforceSchemaConstraintsForOrderCoverAndAltText` and
`#shouldReorderAllNonArchivedMediaAtomically`:

- duplicate `(room_type_id, display_order)` for non-archived media -> `DataIntegrityViolationException`
- second published cover for the same room -> `DataIntegrityViolationException`
- alt text containing `<` -> `DataIntegrityViolationException`
- reorder writes a complete unique 0..n-1 sequence
- archived media is excluded from room order/cover and processing recovery

Result: PASS (MediaIT 7/7).
